Step1: create_candidate(origin_availability_alpha)
Precondition: not candidate_created ?candidate and not dispatched ?candidate.
Both false initially. Effect: candidate_created origin_availability_alpha.

Step2: allocate_vehicle_unit(origin_availability_alpha, vehicle_unit_alpha)
Precondition: candidate_created ?candidate, not vehicle_allocated ?candidate, vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit.
We have candidate_created true, vehicle_allocated false, vehicle_available true. Effect: vehicle_allocated true, candidate_vehicle_linked true, vehicle_available false.

Step3: attach_task_profile(origin_availability_alpha, route_task_profile_alpha)
Precondition: candidate_created ?candidate, vehicle_allocated ?candidate, route_task_profile_available ?route_task_profile.
We have candidate_created true, vehicle_allocated true, route_task_profile_available true. Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked true, route_task_profile_available false.

